Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.97,0:05:13.60,Announcement,,0,0,0,,Squad 5, give a status report. After reporting, begin loading secondary armaments.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.52,0:10:53.96,Announcement,,0,0,0,,The 5th Colonization Planning Group  meeting has been moved to Hall 6.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.59,0:20:21.84,Announcement,,0,0,0,,All crew to combat status 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.84,0:20:24.18,Announcement,,0,0,0,,Repeat: All crew to combat status 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.22,0:01:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain's Log:
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.63,0:01:44.77,Default,,0,0,0,,On Leptapoda, the planet where we landed to resupply, we learned a surprising fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.77,0:01:50.19,Default,,0,0,0,,The Yamato's final destination, Iscandar, which we'd thought a planet of hope,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.19,0:01:54.57,Default,,0,0,0,,is the twin planet of the enemy world, Garmillas.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.57,0:01:59.41,Default,,0,0,0,,The two share a connection about which we were not informed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.99,0:02:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The Garmillans hold Iscandar to be an object of worship.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.00,0:02:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We met with a high-ranking Garmillas official,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.00,0:02:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Admiral Ditz, who'd been imprisoned on Leptapoda.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.67,0:02:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,He and his comrades were rebelling\Nagainst the current leader of Garmillas.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.14,0:02:25.81,Default,,0,0,0,,But given our relationship, quickly putting differences aside was impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.61,0:02:40.45,Default,,0,0,0,,That said, we did gain several useful\Npieces of information about Garmillas.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.78,0:02:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Their leader's name was Abelt Desler.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.79,0:02:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,He ruled over his vast, interstellar empire with a terrible iron fist.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.96,0:02:55.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Admiral Ditz and his forces left for the other prison planets,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.63,0:02:58.59,Default,,0,0,0,,intending to free the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.72,0:03:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We were forced to part ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.57,0:03:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,But even if they would not fight with us, they left a liaison.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.95,0:03:32.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I would like to believe that this will lead to a future of hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.75,0:03:38.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Furthermore, our ship's Operations Officer, kidnapped by the enemy,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.13,0:03:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,was confirmed to be alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.97,0:03:44.51,Default,,0,0,0,,According to Mrs. Domel, who had made contact with her,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.51,0:03:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,the Garmillans believed her to be Yurisha...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.48,0:03:59.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Not yet... Just a little longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.03,0:04:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome, Yurisha, to Great Garmillas.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.45,0:04:11.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I am honored to receive you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.79,0:04:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You haven't forgotten me, have you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.47,0:04:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.55,0:04:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,She's insisting on being allowed aboard a Falcon...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.76,0:04:30.35,Default,,0,0,0,,And he keeps saying he can't allow it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.35,0:04:32.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course I can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.23,0:04:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Melda, what is your mission?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.94,0:04:38.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I am here as a liaison.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.07,0:04:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Do your duties as a liaison involve one of the Yamato's fighters?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.78,0:04:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,They do not.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.42,0:04:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,There you have it, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.32,0:04:47.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well, I will obey.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.37,0:04:50.29,Default,,0,0,0,,So you'll listen to Kodai?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.29,0:04:53.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't we have something she could pilot?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.79,0:04:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,There's the one I used on Balun.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.05,0:05:01.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.84,0:05:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll let you take care of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.42,0:05:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! You're leaving?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.81,0:05:17.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I see... A captured ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.86,0:05:21.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure about this? You'll be shooting at your own people.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.03,0:05:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,That will depend on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.65,0:05:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,The Yamato's mission is to reach Iscandar.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.66,0:05:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Not to go to Garmillas and fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.12,0:05:42.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Or do you want to destroy us out of a desire for revenge?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.05,0:05:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,That isn't true...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.92,0:05:46.43,Default,,0,0,0,,It isn't true anymore, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.55,0:05:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Right? It isn't, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.22,0:05:58.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you're here... I've been meaning to ask you something!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.27,0:06:01.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't point your finger at one from Iscandar!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.65,0:06:07.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't mind. It doesn't bother me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.61,0:06:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.74,0:06:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you tell us Iscandar and Garmillas were at the same place?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.25,0:06:20.25,Default,,0,0,0,,If you'd known, would you have come? Or wouldn't you have?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.88,0:06:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What would we have done if we'd known?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.63,0:06:28.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Would we have still been able to\Nmaintain our desire to go to Iscandar?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.93,0:06:32.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I think we made it this far because we didn't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.26,0:06:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,But I was surprised that they're neighbors.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.27,0:06:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Melda says that Mori is probably on the Garmillas home planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.24,0:06:48.67,Default,,0,0,0,,She's probably being treated well.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.53,0:06:53.49,Default,,0,0,0,,If they still believe she's Yurisha.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.75,0:07:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The moon here is big... Big and beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.29,0:07:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That isn't the moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.01,0:07:09.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't know?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.14,0:07:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,That is Iscandar.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.89,0:07:20.56,Default,,0,0,0,,When did you guess?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.56,0:07:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I wasn't certain until just now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.86,0:07:24.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.44,0:07:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What will you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.32,0:07:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,My duty is to protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.30,0:07:54.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.76,0:07:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.31,0:08:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You may leave, Hilde.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.52,0:08:10.11,Default,,0,0,0,,That girl is the same race as the boy outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.11,0:08:16.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Her father died in battle with a barbarian ship.\NCalled the Yamato, I believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.91,0:08:21.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I wasn't born on this planet, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.71,0:08:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,But she and I are both Garmillans.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.34,0:08:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know who you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.97,0:08:37.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Yurisha of Iscandar.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.64,0:08:38.85,Default,,0,0,0,,No, you are not.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.06,0:08:44.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you are Yurisha of Garmillas. You are a bird in a cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.23,0:08:47.71,Default,,0,0,0,,A mere pawn to use against Iscandar.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.73,0:08:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,"The salvation of all intelligent life in the universe."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.45,0:08:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Your sister's little speech.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.82,0:09:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It's easy for her, isn't it? She does nothing but test others.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.49,0:09:03.64,Default,,0,0,0,,However, our leader is different.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.64,0:09:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,He's trying to build a civilization that spans galaxies.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.25,0:09:13.09,Default,,0,0,0,,He isn't like that woman, who refuses to even dirty her own hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.84,0:09:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Only under imperial protection can eternal peace be possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.81,0:09:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That is true salvation.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.58,0:09:26.37,Default,,0,0,0,,And he can make it a reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.82,0:09:33.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard you stopped at that prison planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.28,0:09:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,How was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.53,0:09:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It was awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.28,0:09:40.95,Default,,0,0,0,,When I was a child, I was sent there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.79,0:09:44.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Simply because I wasn't Garmillan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.46,0:09:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,And he saved us with his own hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.01,0:10:01.43,Default,,0,0,0,,We, who were of another race.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.64,0:10:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you love him?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.89,0:10:08.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.81,0:10:14.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Only, that's such an odd question to hear from an Iscandarian princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.65,0:10:17.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Do I love him?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.33,0:10:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the best tea, from Melan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.04,0:10:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Drink before it gets cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.85,0:10:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Today, we will attend General Domel's memorial ceremony.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.96,0:11:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, the invincible Goer fleet's 3,000  ships are heading directly to Garmillas.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.84,0:11:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,But it will take a minimum of two months.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.30,0:11:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We are working night and day to see you as soon as possible...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.26,0:11:13.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough, Goer, Just do your best.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.32,0:11:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir! {\i1}Ghale Desler!{\i1}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.96,0:11:22.89,Default,,0,0,0,,The Yamato is entering our last line of defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.89,0:11:25.47,Default,,0,0,0,,It's knocking on the door of the Salezar System.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.45,0:11:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm told the Yamato has a gun with the power to destroy planets.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.56,0:11:36.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The question is how to react, with our\Ndefensive fleets almost entirely absent.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.32,0:11:42.49,Default,,0,0,0,,There is no need for worry. I've held a powerful fleet in reserve.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.78,0:11:47.99,Default,,0,0,0,,The Imperial Guard, not the army, will defend its home planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.41,0:11:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, I would like you to hear something.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.13,0:11:54.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.33,0:11:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,That girl is not Yurisha.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.21,0:12:00.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe her to be a Terron.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.63,0:12:03.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you certain?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.11,0:12:04.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I caught a glimpse of something.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.60,0:12:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.43,0:12:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that an issue?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.10,0:12:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Whether she's real is irrelevant.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.31,0:12:21.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The Third Princess of Iscandar has approved the great unification.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.95,0:12:26.24,Default,,0,0,0,,And as long as the people believe that...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.24,0:12:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand. You're correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.08,0:12:32.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time for the ceremony, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.62,0:12:40.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Elk Domel, hero to the people and my dear friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.01,0:12:46.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Your loss tears at my heart...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.51,0:12:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe my beloved citizens feel the same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.70,0:12:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,But sadness will not bring him back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.62,0:12:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What will fill the void he left? Only one thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.94,0:13:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Hope!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.32,0:13:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hope will heal our sadness, and guide the way to our future!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.66,0:13:09.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't see Minister Talan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.49,0:13:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Our lord has ordered him elsewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.66,0:13:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed... They were such friends, I'm sorry to hear that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.85,0:13:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall give you hope!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.42,0:13:25.05,Default,,0,0,0,,The dream of our people, our great destiny...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.05,0:13:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Our great hope, the unification of Garmillas and Iscandar!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.01,0:13:35.98,Default,,0,0,0,,In the distant past, our people were divided in two.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.98,0:13:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it is time for us to become one again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.15,0:13:46.99,Default,,0,0,0,,The Third Princess of Iscandar, Yurisha, has approved this!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.66,0:13:49.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Yurisha?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.54,0:14:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,My people, let us move forward to our hope, the great unification!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.46,0:14:05.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us move into the future!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.05,0:14:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,The endless march of Garmillas,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.55,0:14:11.39,Default,,0,0,0,,toward the future, is what my friend Domel would have desired!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.95,0:14:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,This strategy you've proposed...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.85,0:14:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I cannot agree to the last part.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.08,0:14:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You're kidding, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.34,0:14:39.25,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I can't permit it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.25,0:14:42.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Why? But you...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.09,0:14:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The Yamato's goal is Iscandar.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.30,0:14:45.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Not Garmillas.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.67,0:14:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,A-Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.76,0:14:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Then what happens to her? Do we let her die?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.26,0:14:54.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Garmillas is right next to Iscandar.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.85,0:14:57.43,Default,,0,0,0,,There's time for him to rethink it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.69,0:15:02.31,Default,,0,0,0,,To be honest...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.73,0:15:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain, you...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.61,0:15:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.45,0:15:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,But we've made it this far.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.53,0:15:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.66,0:15:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.00,0:15:22.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Working with those Garmillans just because they're fighting their government...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.79,0:15:24.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what the higher-ups are thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.71,0:15:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,But isn't that Melda person an ally?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.38,0:15:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You're being naïve!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.88,0:15:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It's possible Iscandar and Garmillas are working together to trick us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.64,0:15:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to consider it, but yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.30,0:15:36.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.28,0:15:38.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.81,0:15:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,He's doing that poorly?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.15,0:15:45.61,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, no! We have a duty to confidentiality!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.61,0:15:48.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't tell everyone, Sabu!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.19,0:15:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.74,0:15:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't, Sabu...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.70,0:15:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll keep the confidentiality.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.54,0:16:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,H-Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.46,0:16:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,D-Don't get the wrong idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.08,0:16:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the wrong idea?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.42,0:16:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,She called him "Sabu."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.68,0:16:16.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you not have one? Someone like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.85,0:16:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,No one's asking you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.85,0:16:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.14,0:16:23.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh?! Who? Is it Kodai?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.35,0:16:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,No way... Not a chance. S-So who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.65,0:16:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,They are not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.44,0:16:30.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, they're on Iscandar?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.15,0:16:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You're being rude, asking so many questions!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.24,0:16:34.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Won't you eat, Melda?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.95,0:16:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.16,0:16:39.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Well... I...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.91,0:16:42.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you sure this is food?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.79,0:16:46.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Magellan Parfait. It's a popular dessert on board.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.38,0:16:50.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.67,0:16:53.22,Default,,0,0,0,,O-Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.72,0:17:01.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.98,0:17:04.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe such a thing existed in this universe...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.77,0:17:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.90,0:17:08.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm very moved right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.15,0:17:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You have some on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.40,0:17:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, did you ask about that other thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.08,0:17:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.54,0:17:24.75,Default,,0,0,0,,She insists it has to be this colour...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.75,0:17:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.75,0:17:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't understand women...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.21,0:17:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.97,0:17:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Is something funny?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.09,0:17:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so cute, Melda.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.89,0:17:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You honor me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.06,0:17:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You really are cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.64,0:17:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't get to say it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.18,0:17:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Getting back on topic...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.02,0:17:47.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.06,0:17:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it true you have someone waiting for you on Iscandar?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.15,0:17:56.65,Default,,0,0,0,,When I get back, there is something I must tell them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.65,0:17:58.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going to confess that you like them?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.41,0:17:59.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.82,0:18:02.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It is not my decision...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.12,0:18:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Message from the XO.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.83,0:18:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,At shipboard time 1100, we will enter warp.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.21,0:18:14.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, stand by in type-2 space gear.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.15,0:18:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It's still at eighty percent functionality.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.44,0:18:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe it's a bit early to use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.36,0:18:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't mind, Talan. As long as we can use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.74,0:18:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, if I may speak freely, this facility\Nwas meant for when we moved the capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.16,0:18:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It wasn't intended for use against the Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.79,0:18:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I said I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.30,0:18:58.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Zar Belk.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.88,0:19:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The Yamato is coming... They're safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.01,0:19:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,They've come a long, long way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.68,0:19:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We must greet them properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.56,0:19:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You may stay here and watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.36,0:19:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What is about to happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.28,0:19:18.11,Default,,0,0,0,,A war.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.74,0:19:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Crew, Earth is 160,000 light years behind us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.62,0:19:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,But that is just a number.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.54,0:19:30.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Earth is right behind us!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.37,0:19:34.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It is right behind us, awaiting your return.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.61,0:19:41.55,Default,,0,0,0,,We will soon reach our final objective, the Salezar System.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.55,0:19:45.97,Default,,0,0,0,,But the enemy's home planet is there, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.97,0:19:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It is both our goal and also enemy territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.19,0:19:53.98,Default,,0,0,0,,But we will choose the path to Iscandar.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.98,0:19:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Because that is where hope lies.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.44,0:20:04.87,Default,,0,0,0,,And because the Earth is behind us, awaiting our return with that hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.16,0:20:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The Yamato will now enter warp,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.12,0:20:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,our last major warp before Iscandar.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.58,0:20:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,All crew will maintain combat status 1 and prepare for warp!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.94,0:20:39.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Engines at full power.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.95,0:20:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Enter warp!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.87,0:20:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Entering warp!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.73,0:21:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Epidora, fifth planet in the Salezar System.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.48,0:21:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,There is a twin planet in the fourth orbit.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.94,0:21:20.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Magnify.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.70,0:21:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Iscandar?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.34,0:21:29.49,Default,,0,0,0,,But next to it...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.17,0:21:38.81,Default,,0,0,0,,No ships on cosmo radar.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.81,0:21:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,No enemies in a radius of fifty light seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.39,0:21:50.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It's quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.66,0:22:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,High energy readings at point L-1 between Garmillas and Iscandar!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.53,0:24:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,The enemy unleashes the light of despair upon the Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.54,0:24:22.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Will the Yamato be blown apart just as it reaches its destination?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.21,0:24:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Overcome this deadly peril and advance, Yamato!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.40,0:24:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Your goal is the enemy's heart: Desler's Palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.65,0:24:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Next time: One Man's War.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.01,0:24:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,There are 210 days left before humanity is extinct.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.53,0:05:49.91,Gamila,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,942)\blur7.5\shad0\bord2}Rud Iscandar.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.06,0:08:05.33,Gamila,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,942)\blur7.5\shad0\bord2}Rud Iscandar.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.37,0:14:14.08,Tsing 1,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5\shad0\bord2\i1}Ghale Garmillan!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.52,0:14:16.27,Tsing 1,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5\shad0\bord2\i1}Ghale Garmillan!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.85,0:14:18.62,Tsing 1,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5\shad0\bord2\i1}Ghale Garmillan!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.35,0:14:21.31,Tsing 1,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5\shad0\bord2\i1}Ghale Iscandar!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.23,0:14:24.19,Tsing 1,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5\shad0\bord2\i1}Ghale Desler!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.19,0:14:27.15,Tsing 1,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5\shad0\bord2\i1}Ghale Phuzeron!{\i}
