Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.50,0:22:44.30,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}Among the distant stars
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.30,0:22:48.39,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}Can you hear the wandering souls?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.39,0:23:02.36,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)}In this galaxy, they can forever rest in peace
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.36,0:23:06.03,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Requiem of separation
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.03,0:23:09.53,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}With this requiem
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.53,0:23:12.16,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)}Sing Along!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.20,0:23:16.79,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Voices sing to praise
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.79,0:23:20.42,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}An unforgettable memory
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.42,0:23:25.38,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)}And we’ll never forget your name
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.97,0:23:32.68,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}Farewell friend,\Nmy sorrow
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.68,0:23:35.10,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}Will not run out
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.10,0:23:40.19,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)}Someday in this sea of stars
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.19,0:23:42.32,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Surely
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.32,0:23:43.99,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Pray for the Earth!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.99,0:23:45.99,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}The oath
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.99,0:23:47.66,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Pray for the dream!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.66,0:23:49.62,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}The ideal
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.87,0:23:58.92,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,1000)}Last forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.54,0:00:22.50,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}Farewell, Earth
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.50,0:00:26.13,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}The ship that is departing is
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.13,0:00:30.30,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}The Space Battleship
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.30,0:00:35.39,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,2000)\blur7\be2}Yamato
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.77,0:00:39.52,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\pos(777,60)\be2}It departs now to Iscandar,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.52,0:00:44.36,OP,,900,0,0,,{\an9\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}at the end of the cosmos,\Nbearing its fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.36,0:00:51.91,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}"We will come back, no matter what it takes"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.91,0:01:00.71,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}Answer with a smile to the waving people
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.50,0:01:05.21,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}Going far from the Galaxy towards Iscandar
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.21,0:01:08.63,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}A faint gleam of hope
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.63,0:01:16.18,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,3000)\blur7\be2}The Space Battleship Yamato
